<article>
	<h1><span>Projects: Activity</span></h1>

	<ul class="nav">
		<li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li>
		<li><a href="#filters">Filters</a></li>
		<li><a href="#column-headers">Column Headers</a></li>
		<li><a href="#toolbar">Toolbar</a></li>
		<li><a href="#sub-menu">Sub-menu Links</a></li>
	</ul>

	<section id="overview">
		<h2><span>Overview</span></h2>

		<p>This screen lists the activity entries of projects.</p>
		<p>When it is opened for one project, a heading row shows <strong>Projects</strong> &gt; (alias) title of
			that project. <strong>Projects</strong> links back to the list of projects.</p>
	</section>
	<section id="filters">
		<h2><span>Filters</span></h2>
		<p>Above the list are these filters:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>Filter:</dt>
			<dd>A text box (&quot;Keyword or phrase...&quot;) with <strong>Search</strong> and <strong>Clear</strong>
				buttons.</dd>

			<dt>- Action -</dt>
			<dd>Shows only entries with the chosen action: created, updated, deleted, joined, uploaded, accepted,
				cancelled, submitted or emailed.</dd>

			<dt>- Filter -</dt>
			<dd>Choose <strong>Starred</strong> to show only starred entries.</dd>

			<dt>- State -</dt>
			<dd>A choice of Unpublished, Published or Trashed; <em>- State -</em> lists every state. The list opens
				showing published entries.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
	<section id="column-headers">
		<h2><span>Column Headers</span></h2>

		<dl>
			<dt>Checkbox</dt>
			<dd>Check this box to select one or more items. To select all items, check the box in the column heading.
				After one or more boxes are checked, click a toolbar button to take an action on the selected item or
				items.</dd>

			<dt>ID</dt>
			<dd>The identification number of the entry, assigned by the system.</dd>

			<dt>Created</dt>
			<dd>The date and time the entry was created.</dd>

			<dt>Creator</dt>
			<dd>The name of the user who created the entry, or &quot;unknown&quot;.</dd>

			<dt>Action</dt>
			<dd>The action that was done, such as created or updated.</dd>

			<dt>Description</dt>
			<dd>The first 100 characters of the description, without formatting. For a comment, the description
				links to the comment's editing screen.</dd>

			<dt>Project</dt>
			<dd>The alias of the project. It links to the project's editing screen.</dd>

			<dt>State</dt>
			<dd>Shows whether the entry is Published, Unpublished or Trashed. If you may change the state, click the
				icon to publish an unpublished or trashed entry, or to unpublish a published one.</dd>

			<dt>Starred</dt>
			<dd>Yes or No. If you may change the state, click it to star or unstar the entry.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
	<section id="toolbar">
		<h2><span>Toolbar</span></h2>
		<p>At the top right you will see the toolbar.</p>
		<p>The functions are:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>Delete</dt>
			<dd>Asks for confirmation, then deletes the selected entries. Only shown if you may delete.</dd>

			<dt>Help</dt>
			<dd>Opens this help screen.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
	<section id="sub-menu">
		<h2><span>Sub-menu Links</span></h2>
		<p>At the top left, you will see sub-menu options. The links are:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>Projects</dt>
			<dt>Activity (this page)</dt>
		</dl>
	</section>
</article>
